This is the evaluation criteria for the Implementation Plan Rag Enhanced Signal Intelligence Plan

Ingest
- Surge, Sam and onboarding context saved
- We build up an org file, to have a complete view of sam, surge, the org
- Datasets ingested appropriately, e.g. zoho desk, zoho crm, product usage Datasets
- Datasets cleaned up appropriately, to give quality data
- If necessary, datasets to be normalised

KPI engine
- Our system understands what KPIs should be useful for surge, sam, their organisation. It ingests whatever is necessary to perform that recommendation.
- Our system  can explain what each kpi means, how it's calculated, generally (e.g. with normalised data)

Verify needs
- Users can see their context info, e.g. see their profile, requested kpis, recommended KPIs
- User feels like system understands their needs

Signal card
- Users can view a signal card, relevant to them. e.g. requested or recommended 
Signl card Includes
-  kpi (relevant to that particular user)
- kpi absolute value (that is appropriate for the KPI)
- KPI trend (that is appropriate for that KPI)
- Explanation of how the KPI was calculated, e.g. provenance, where data came from etc.
- drivers for the KPI, and the logic for that driver
- so what, for that kpi, and the logic for that so what
